WEBVTT

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.440
From back then?!

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:38.120
This isn't the first time we've met, is it?

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:39.690
Kou Shuurei-san.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.380
Haven't your breasts grown bigg—

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:12.170
Even if that's true, surely you could pretend that you didn't notice?

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:17.550
"You look beautiful," or "You really do look like a princess." Those sorts of compliments...

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:20.050
Seiran, I can hear you.

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:22.370
I can't help it! I'm a decoy, remember?!

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.760
Umm, no, we never said it was bad.

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:28.250
That's right. There's nothing bad about it.

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:32.300
Whether they're fake or not, men prefer them bigg—

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:35.660
What's wrong with smaller ones?

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:37.760
It's not oujo-sama's fault!

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:40.300
Don't you think your family retainer is rude?!

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:42.340
You're both rude!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.780
I agree, they're really rude.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.200
Breasts just get in your way.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:49.630
They're heavy, and they start to sag as you get older!

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:51.310
Jyuusan-hime.

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:56.280
Just a quick question. Who's in charge of the security here?

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.280
I believe the Ministry of Arms is in charge this time.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.740
Are you involved with the security?

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:07.790
No, but if something is bothering you,
I can make them review the security procedures.

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:11.290
No, don't worry about it. Keep it as it is.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:14.710
Ouch...

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:19.420
Hey Tan-tan, can you find out about
that guy Shun we met at the prison?

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:24.550
His appearance is unique, so I believe many people will remember him.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:28.200
Got it. Well, I'm off now.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.560
I'm counting on you.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:36.060
Lunch will be ready soon.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.940
Thank you, Shusui.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.830
Hey, Shuurei-chan.

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:40.800
Chan?

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:42.790
Oh, can't I?

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:45.300
Of course. I just wasn't used to it.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.200
So, what did you want to ask?

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:51.960
I'll be fishing in the pond over there, so call me when lunch is served.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.530
Is fishing your hobby?

00:03:56.530 --> 00:04:00.420
Nah, my hobby is riding horses.
Let's go riding together sometime.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.050
I'm going to catch fish to test for poison in the food.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:07.550
Ah, what about a fishing rod?

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:11.560
I can manage with a string and some bait.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:15.740
Umm, you really are a princess of the Ran family, right?

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:19.040
I am, but I wasn't raised in the main family.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.320
The place where I grew up has made me who I am.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:23.340
Anyway, don't worry about that too much.

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:27.070
But we do worry.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:30.940
S-Seiran, bring us a fishing rod tomorrow...

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:33.740
Also, please escort her when she goes fishing.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.020
Yes, my lady.

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:00.520
Poisoned!

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:02.530
I thought so.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.530
Let's review the security arrangements.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:08.620
No. If we tighten security,

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:12.860
they'll start to use less obvious methods, and the situation will be more dangerous.

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:15.660
We'll be fine as long as we stay vigilant.

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:20.720
Seiran, bring us food every day from now on, please.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:22.920
I'll prepare all the meals.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.730
Oh, yes!

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:29.050
I get to eat those dishes everyone was talking about, the cooking that even Ryuuren-nii-sama admired!

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:41.570
Shuurei-chan, let's sleep together.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.110
Huh?

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.160
U-Umm, sure...

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:48.570
I still have work to do, so please go to bed first.

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:50.060
Okay.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.320
There are two of them sneaking around.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:10.130
Really, the security here is full of holes.

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:12.690
No wonder Shuuei-nii-sama was amazed.

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:15.770
Even if this is intended to make the assassins drop their guard...

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:38.500
I can defeat them easily,

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:42.130
but if I do that on the first day,
then they won't lower their guard.

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:51.680
They're gone.

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:56.590
Jyuusan-hime? You'll catch a cold.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:59.030
True, sorry.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:04.190
Shuuei-nii-sama and I aren't after those small fry.

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:07.190
What matters is whether <i>he's</i> involved.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:21.990
Well, I didn't recognize you.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:23.620
You've surprised me more than I expected.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:27.760
That's the best compliment I've received so far.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:33.800
The men around you don't know how to behave around women?

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:37.060
You're one to talk. You prefer me like this as well, don't you?

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:38.520
Huh?

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:42.560
I prefer your usual appearance.
I don't care for how you look now.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.560
What? How can that be?

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:45.970
It's a question of preference.

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:49.570
I don't like women who are really feminine.

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:55.820
Why are you the only representative of that minority so far?

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:57.650
Too bad.

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.220
We'd better get going.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:07.560
Y-Your behavior is quite gentlemanly right now.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:12.730
Of course. You're Jyuusan-hime right now.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:16.900
If you're not going to be useful as a decoy,
I'll force you off this mission using my authority.

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:27.500
Don't worry. I'll be kind to Jyuusan-hime.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:33.400
I'll only half-listen to the words of someone who intends to run off on his own in a crisis.

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:35.910
That's wise.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:46.810
It's almost the new moon, and that Seiga guy has made his move, which means...

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.670
Did you send for me, miss?

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:56.090
Would you please deliver this to Shuuei-nii-sama?

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.180
Quickly, please.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.410
It's an important letter.

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:02.990
Yes, I understand.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.440
Now then.

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:14.400
Are you Jyuusan-hime?

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:22.210
Pleased to meet you, Your Highness.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.460
So, how about going fishing with me?

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:34.120
I can't let you into the Imperial Residence.

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:38.640
Because you love Shuurei-chan?

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:39.410
Chan?

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:43.580
Is it possible that the two of them are becoming friends?

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:45.390
What kind of conversation did they have?

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.800
Please take care of Ryuuki.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.150
Leave him to me, Shuurei-chan!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.530
Oh, don't you love her?

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:57.490
I do! I love her! I love her to pieces!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:01.160
That's why I can't love you or see you as a woman.

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:04.090
Well, that's fine.

00:10:04.090 --> 00:10:06.160
I love someone else too.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:12.020
I made a promise to my older triplet brothers.

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:16.210
In exchange for saving someone's life,
I'd do anything they asked.

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:20.180
I'm repaying my debt from back then by entering the Imperial Residence.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:24.170
Don't you want to be with him and live happily?

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:27.280
There's no point in making promises if you don't keep them.

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:29.690
You're right.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:33.540
Shuurei-chan is doing her best just for you.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:35.130
She loves you.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:36.690
Do you actually realize that?

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:39.700
I do.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:43.450
But you want her to try even harder.

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:49.960
I promise you.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:52.820
I'll sort out the assassins.

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:54.410
I won't die, for sure.

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:57.970
But something's bothering me.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:02.340
I'll protect your precious Shuurei-chan, no matter what it takes.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:04.350
Jyuusan-hime...

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.380
Hey, Emperor,

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:09.210
in this world, do you think there's a solution that makes everything

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:11.600
work out in the end, regardless of the difficulties?

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:16.520
I've been looking for that solution ever since I let go of Shuurei.

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:17.590
Is that so?

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:20.610
Then, maybe you'll be the third man.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:22.610
The third?

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.340
I hear there are two men who can solve problems neatly,

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:28.280
no matter how complicated they are.

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:33.150
The first is one of my older triplet brothers, and the second is in the Kou family.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:36.160
You might become the third.

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:41.130
By the way, I have a message from Shuuei-nii-sama.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.850
"The next time he sees me will be the last."

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.220
That's what he said.

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:51.570
I-I got it.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:05.090
Shusui-san?!

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:08.750
Shusui-san?

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:10.450
My apologies.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:12.420
I just felt a little dizzy.

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:15.580
Thank you, I'm fine now.

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:20.000
Umm, is there something?

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.270
I just think you're really beautiful.

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:26.850
I know it's rude of me to ask this,
but what do you think of Shuuei-nii-sama?

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:28.760
Would you consider him?

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.600
I'm sorry, but...

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:37.110
Oh. From what I'd heard, he's quite popular
among the court ladies, despite his character.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:43.110
True, if I hadn't chased him away all the time, he'd probably have been even more popular.

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:48.320
Since Ran-shogun arrived at the Imperial Court and began meddling in the Residence,

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:50.740
my difficulties have increased enormously.

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:53.220
He's been such a nuisance to me.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:54.870
I-I'm so sorry!

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.950
As his younger sister, I'm embarrassed!

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:00.630
N-No, I'm sorry. I said too much.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.730
Please don't be concerned. What you said is true.

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:08.850
But, it's quite unusual for a woman outside the family to complain about my brother.

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:11.140
He has no faults that are visible to outsiders.

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:15.530
He's been taught not to show his weaknesses,

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:19.980
so it's unusual to find a person to whom my brother would reveal himself.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.030
Is that so?

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:26.220
Well, he's really, completely beneath her notice.

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:27.810
This is going to be tough.

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:30.030
You can't get your way with just your looks, brother.

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:38.040
Is there something you'd like to ask me?

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:42.300
Yes. My presumptuousness may offend you, but...

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:48.800
Please come into the Imperial Residence for Ryuuki-sama's sake.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.630
That bastard Seiga.

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:05.080
How much more obvious could he make a decoy?

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:21.680
Oh, a firefly.

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:24.300
Wow. It's already that time of the year.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:34.760
Isn't the person on this carriage...

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:36.950
that government official girl?

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:43.020
Have you managed to look up the ghosts of the prison dead?

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.510
I have.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:49.070
Who... are you?

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:51.330
A ghost.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:53.530
I'm one of the ghosts of the prison dead.

00:14:56.860 --> 00:15:01.080
Make sure you do everything Jyuusan-hime tells you to do.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:05.320
Ordinary assassins won't stand a chance if you let her deal with them.

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:06.840
You won't die.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:10.860
He talks as if he knows Jyuusan-hime.

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:13.800
The attempt will take place on the night of the new moon.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:17.100
On that night, make sure Ran Shuuei is ready for it.

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:18.800
Ran-shogun?

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:19.720
Yes.

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:23.100
Also, it's better if you don't tell Riku Seiga about me.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.270
Feign ignorance.

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:29.880
That way, perhaps a solution that fixes everything may come about.

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:33.190
It will be very difficult to get there, though.

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:36.120
If everyone thinks and thinks and thinks,

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.260
and makes their choices without compromising, then...

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:44.670
Huh? A firefly. Seriously, how suggestive.

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:50.450
Oujo-chan, you really do remind me of the woman I loved.

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.500
A woman who was like a firefly.

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:06.240
You were talking for a long time.

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:07.770
What kind of acquaintance is he?

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:11.280
Isn't your real interest, "What kind of conversation were you having?"

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:16.780
Anyway, if he were an acquaintance,
what else would he do besides talk?

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.780
Assault me, for instance?

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.320
He didn't assault you though, did he?

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:29.790
Seiga, nobody came, and nothing happened.

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:34.880
You've gotten smarter, haven't you, Shuurei?

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:38.570
Very well, I'll probably see him in the near future anyway.

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:42.360
He called me Shuurei for the first time.

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:45.060
What?

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:46.850
It's starting to come loose.

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:49.860
I'll do your hair. I'm quite good at it.

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:56.670
Huh?

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:03.680
Where are you planning to take me?

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:04.950
I wonder.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:06.900
The door is locked from the outside.

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:08.460
It's pointless to make a fuss.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:16.180
You're the one who will suffer if I miss my aim.

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:19.720
I'd get away with just a month's suspension.

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.910
This is just to pass the time. Bear with me.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:29.770
To pass the time?

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:33.650
I wondered who would come and pick you up.

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:45.440
You look better like this.

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.750
Why are you so used to doing this?

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.420
Do you have a younger sister?

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.920
Don't bother asking questions you can answer with simple research.

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:02.630
Wh-Why are you coming close?

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:04.980
If something tries to run, you'd want to catch it, wouldn't you?

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:07.300
You lack sex appeal.

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:09.600
A grown-up man and woman alone in a carriage...

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:12.320
I can feel my heart fluttering in anticipation.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:16.330
In my eyes, you're just enjoying being a bully.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:20.320
Then things that make my heart flutter must be everywhere.

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:24.110
What are you going to do?

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:26.050
I wonder.

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:30.370
Why don't you try to get into my good books,
like you did with Anjuu-sama?

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:35.250
He... doesn't trust women.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:42.610
I'd never try to get into your good books.

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:45.260
There's nothing you can take from me.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:48.190
No matter how much we're together in the future, that will never change.

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:51.270
Well, don't forget those words!

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:03.780
You're lucky.

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:12.730
Hurrah!

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:14.040
Cheers for that horse!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.420
When I get back, I'll go down to the stable and feed it lots of carrots!

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:21.700
Hey, after being disturbed like that,
I actually feel reluctant to leave you.

00:19:34.430 --> 00:19:35.690
Ran-shogun?

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:38.890
Hi there, Shuurei-dono. I've come to pick you up.

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:41.610
I'd been informed that an official's carriage was wandering in an odd direction,

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:43.460
so I wondered what was going on.

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:45.420
Inspector Riku, is it?

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:49.200
Of course, you don't mind if I take Shuurei-dono back, do you?

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:51.470
No, not at all.

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.300
Ran-shogun...

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:05.470
It's interesting that you, of all people, came for her.

00:20:13.030 --> 00:20:15.480
May I ask what happened?

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:20.230
I was told to make sure you were at the Imperial Residence on the night of the new moon.

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:22.820
I see. Thank you.

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:27.680
Don't tell anyone but Jyuusan-hime about that man.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:28.900
Not even the Emperor.

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:29.990
Yes, sir.

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:36.000
Do you believe there's always a way to make things come out right?

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:40.860
The man who came to see me was talking about the same thing.

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:42.380
And what did you say?

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:46.400
I do, I did, and I always will.

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:47.760
What about you, Ran-shogun?

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:51.500
I've never believed it.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.020
No, not even once.

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:02.450
That hairstyle really suits you.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:04.650
It may be the best hairstyle for you.

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:07.910
Did Shusui do your hair?

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:12.610
I sense a certain confidence about it, like "I know you best."

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:17.890
Ran-shogun, I won't ask twice.

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:20.960
Would you please tell me what you think of Ryuuki?

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:25.220
I like him.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:32.970
But then, Shuurei-dono, liking him is
different from swearing loyalty to him.

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:36.040
I've finally realized that,

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:38.980
but perhaps I'm too late.

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:46.780
He's not carrying the iris sword that Ryuuki presented to him.

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:59.290
Gosh, what happened to your hair?

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:02.910
You look like you want to scream right now.

00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:04.770
How did you know?

00:22:04.770 --> 00:22:07.330
But before that, I want to feed the horse some carrots!

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:10.440
The horse? Let's go together!

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:13.680
You really like horses, don't you, Jyuusan-hime?

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:18.830
A firefly...

00:22:18.830 --> 00:22:20.440
I've seen a lot of them today.

00:22:26.690 --> 00:22:32.410
Jyuusan-hime, do you know a dark-skinned, one-eyed man?

00:22:32.940 --> 00:22:34.270
Have you met him?!

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:35.200
Yes.

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:41.870
I'm sorry, but I can't go with you to feed carrots to the horse.

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:52.600
There's something Seiga knows that I don't.

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:56.850
Seiga used me to lure Ran-shogun out...

00:22:57.430 --> 00:22:58.680
but for what purpose?

00:22:58.680 --> 00:23:01.350
I... want to be a horse.

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:17.920
You say the assassins who were after Jyuusan-hime

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:21.420
are now after you, the person in charge of guarding Jyuusan-hime?

00:23:22.220 --> 00:23:24.290
We will protect you.

00:23:25.310 --> 00:23:27.020
Please rest assured.

00:24:45.280 --> 00:24:48.670
I became the double of Jyuusan-hime in order to protect her from assassins.

00:24:48.670 --> 00:24:50.570
Then, Ryuuki turned up.

00:24:50.570 --> 00:24:53.260
Why is the Emperor lurking in the stable?!

00:24:53.260 --> 00:24:56.140
What? You want to be a horse? Go ahead, do as you will!

00:24:56.140 --> 00:24:57.140
"Whinny," as they say!
